  story:[ "<b>The treatment vault has been sealed.</b> Patient photographs, output logs, and plan revisions now sit under separate evidence tags.", "Therapist Iyla, The Dosimetrist, and The Clerk move between the machine, planning room, and director's office with records that do not yet agree.", "The two attractive conclusions are <b>A rogue software or computer glitch</b> and <b>A one-off patient reaction — sheer misfortune</b>. Both avoid tracing the dose from prescription to tissue.", "Another cohort is due to begin treatment in eight days. The commission must decide what can safely resume before the schedule becomes an argument of its own." ],
